sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff MANAGE_INVENTORY
    actor Citizen as Citizen (User only)
    participant Ctrl as UserGamificationController / StaffGamificationController
    participant TreeSvc as VirtualTreeService
    participant FactSvc as EcoFactService
    participant PtsSvc as PointsService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Staff,DB: U-15 & S-09: Quan tri Eco Fact va Tuoi/Nang cap Cay ao mo khoa kien thuc (BR-GAM-06, BR-GAM-08)

    Staff->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/staff/eco-facts (title, content, unlockTreeLevel)
    Ctrl->>FactSvc: CreateAsync(staffId, request)
    FactSvc->>DB: Validate UnlockTreeLevel in [1..MaxLevel] & INSERT eco_facts (Status=ACTIVE)
    Ctrl-->>Staff: 201 Created EcoFactDto

    Citizen->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/gamification/tree/upgrade
    Ctrl->>TreeSvc: WaterAndUpgradeAsync(userId)
    TreeSvc->>DB: EnsureTreeAsync + Check TreeLevel < MaxLevel & DailyWaterCount < DailyTreeCareLimit
    TreeSvc->>DB: BeginTransaction: UPDATE virtual_tree_progress SET tree_level += 1 WHERE user_id = userId AND tree_level = currentLevel
    alt Concurrent request win hoac het luot ngay
        TreeSvc-->>Ctrl: BusinessRuleException (BR-GAM-06, MSG-GEN-01)
    else Tang cap hop le
        TreeSvc->>PtsSvc: TryDebitAsync(userId, next.RequiredPoints, TreeCare, TREE:userId:L_next)
        alt Khong du diem
            PtsSvc-->>TreeSvc: false -> Rollback cap cay
            TreeSvc-->>Ctrl: BusinessRuleException (BR-GAM-03, MSG-GAM-03)
        else Tru diem & Mo khoa thanh cong
            TreeSvc->>DB: Commit Transaction & SELECT eco_facts WHERE status = 'ACTIVE' AND unlock_tree_level = newLevel
            Ctrl-->>Citizen: 200 OK MSG-GAM-06 (WaterTreeResultDto + unlockedFacts)
        end
    end

    Staff->>Ctrl: DELETE /api/v1/staff/eco-facts/{id}
    Ctrl->>FactSvc: DeleteAsync(id)
    FactSvc->>DB: Check ANY virtual_tree_progress.tree_level >= fact.UnlockTreeLevel
    alt Da co nguoi dat cap mo khoa
        FactSvc->>DB: UPDATE eco_facts SET status = 'INACTIVE' (Bao toan lich su BR-GAM-06)
    else Chua co ai dat cap nay
        FactSvc->>DB: DELETE FROM eco_facts WHERE id = id
    end
    Ctrl-->>Staff: 200 OK
